JVMud LP245 help

Common commands:
  look, examine thing, exa thing
  north, south, east, west
  get thing, get all, drop thing
  inventory, i, score, save, quit
  say message, tell player message
  kill creature, stop

Objects can add their own commands when you carry them or stand near them.
For example, a torch-like stick can usually be used with:
  light stick
  extinguish stick

Type help topic for more detail when a topic exists.
